:: Mansion Bedroom Masturbate Sex Finish
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	Avery gathers <<himself>>, letting out a slow, satisfied sigh, then smiles like <<he>> is enjoying <<himself>> despite your situation. "Do that again, and I'm going to eat you whole."
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>>you tremble, but you force yourself to hold it together as you try to settle back down.<br><br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You kick Avery away from you.
	<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100) and $averyragerevealed gte 1>>
		<<He>> scoffs, gathers <<himself>> up, and pointedly refuses to look at you.
	<<else>>
		<<He>> scoffs and gathers <<himself>> up.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>>you tremble, but you force yourself to hold it together as you try to settle back down.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100) and $averyragerevealed gte 1>>
		<<He>> scoffs, gathers <<himself>> up, and punches the lamp on <<his>> bedside cabinet in frustration.
	<<else>>
		Avery scoffs and pointedly refuses to look at you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>>you tremble, but you force yourself to hold it together as you try to settle back down.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<br>

