<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mansion Bedroom Masturbate Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>


:: Mansion Bedroom Masturbate Fight Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	Out of strength, Avery collapses. <<tearful>> you use the opportunity to escape from arm's reach.<<larage>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<His>> knees tremble as <<he>> climbs to <<his>> feet. <<He>> glares at you a moment, then walks away.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	Avery's knees buckle, and <<he>> collapses in a heap. <<tearful>> you use the opportunity to escape from arm's reach.<<larage>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><<ldom>><<npcincr Avery dom -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you recover.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	You fall to the ground, too hurt to continue fighting. Avery observes you a moment, considering, then <<he>> walks away.<<ggdom>><<npcincr Avery dom 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you struggle to your feet.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<endcombat>>
<<clotheson>>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Bedroom]]>><</link>>
